     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nHi everyone,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nPlease help us spread the word about the postdoc position described here:</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<a href=\"https://chandlerlab.uga.edu/opportunities/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://chandlerlab.uga.edu/opportunities/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492793090000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0TAXSsE0_Vy0WI7XY_QywR\">https://chandlerlab.uga.edu/opportunities/</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nWe&#39;re looking for someone with expertise in spatial capture-recapture and landscape genetic connectivity. </div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nRegards,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,